Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.73,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:49.86,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Tonan University
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.70,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,The 2nd year on campus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Miss Kotoko Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:05.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:08.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please be my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:18.31,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Itazurana Kiss THE MOVIE 3 Proposal Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Someone confessed his love to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Summer vacation just ended! Who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Taketo Nakagawa, a first year \Nstudent in the Law Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:28.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:31.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you playing a joke on Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:32.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No, I'm sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:33.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:36.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko's been hung up \Non the same guy for four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You mean Naoki Irie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:41.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I also graduated from Tonan High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:44.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I know she's been living in Irie's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then why ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:48.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, they're not actually dating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:51.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, I figured I still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:55.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? He asked you out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:56.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:01.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's all Naoki's fault. \NHe's always drags everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:04.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:10.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:12.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nakagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:14.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry if I freaked you out, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:15.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:16.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No, I'm sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:30.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've had my eye ever \Nsince I got into Tonan HS.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:33.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was in class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:35.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then you must be pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:39.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When I was in high school, \NI wanted to be like Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:42.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And that's how I found \Nout about you, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've liked me all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:44.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:47.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, now, Irie has \Nbecome my competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:51.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But I've only just met you, Nakagawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:55.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why not go out on a date, then?\NYou can get to know me better, that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you free on Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:12.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:14.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:23.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad? Auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:26.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She said some pest's started \Nbuzzing around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:32.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Has a cheery and direct personality, \Nand is an academic over-achiever...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:35.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wanted to see what was up, so I came...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But he seems like a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:40.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Aihara, you're not supposed \Nto be impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:42.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:59.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, someone normal is\Nactually interested in {\i1}you{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:02.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you getting at? \NGuys like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Guess there really \Nis someone for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:06.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse me? Why wouldn't someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:08.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Y'know, he might not be you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:16.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but he's handsome, smart, and \Nunlike you, he can actually be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:22.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, Irie, you don't mind \Nif Kotoko and I go out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's not mine. Feel free \Nto do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:32.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Taketo, where will we be going on our date?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:35.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, we're on for the date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:36.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:38.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:40.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nakagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:41.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:44.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:46.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I should ask you how do \Nyou two know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm dating Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well... not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:05:01.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seems like smooth sailing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:06.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, chasing after someone as unattainable \Nas Irie, for your whole life, would be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:14.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You trying to shack up with Kotoko \Nwithout saying anything to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:19.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You got some balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:21.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're not going out with her though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:22.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The hell you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:25.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Kotoko, tell him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm not dating Kin, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:37.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Looks like my plan to make Naoki \Njealous is working like I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:41.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll bet he's seething right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And then he'll fall for you, even harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:47.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm positive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:54.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm not sure of is \Nhow to get him to witness your date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:03.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have you decided your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:05.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Iced milk tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Were you waiting long, Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:08.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Today, we're on date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:14.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Irie, I'll take an iced coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Certainly. Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you risking spilling it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's more fun this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you go to Yokohama often?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:25.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I have to say, this place is pretty great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:29.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Great for hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:30.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:36.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow, you're amazing, Taketo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:39.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It went in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:48.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I got one! Yes! Taketo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:07:00.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:02.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:05.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It really felt like a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I had a ton of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:19.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Next time, let's watch a movie \Nor go to an amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:23.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If only I was with Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Does that sound good, Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:28.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,May I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:40.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:47.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've got weird taste in girls, Nakgawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:50.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What exactly about Kotoko is good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I like girls with cute personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:55.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Girls who are smart \Nand hot tend to be nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't be so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You actually think you're hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:03.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Because I don't like women with huge egos, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:06.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't concentrate next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:08.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For that, it refers to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:41.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you doing? \NYou look preoccupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:47.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were watching Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:50.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Taketo, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:52.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You should just forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:08:56.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:08:59.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:00.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:01.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you still hung up on Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:11.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:15.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you two seriously fighting over {\i1}this{\i0} girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:18.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's none of your business! Buzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:21.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But I'm the one Kotoko loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That makes your little \Nbrawl a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:24.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have you finished today's classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:27.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:39.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You are {\i1}so{\i0} stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:45.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dumped and then beaten up.\N Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:46.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:48.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:09:59.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:01.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Were you a little jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:04.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was obviously one of my mom's schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You see through everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:14.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of work to do on yourself \Nbefore you can think about making me jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:15.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:24.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:28.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm working here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:31.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:35.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, the older Matsumoto sister is here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:37.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you're always with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:52.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop day-dreaming and clear tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:54.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:22.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Irie, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:25.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nothing... apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:29.46,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Autumn
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:37.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Taketo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here I am. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:47.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When's your next class?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:48.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fourth period.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:51.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's still some time then. \NLet's get something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:52.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:01.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's one less rival for Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:06.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:10.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:17.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,These reactions...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.55,0:12:19.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you must've done something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:22.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Nothing I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:29.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:32.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Modeled after Kotoko Aihara."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:34.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The body shape is totally off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Were you in the anime club all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:40.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't actually join!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:43.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We meet again, Kotorin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:45.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Aoki of the Anime Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten \Nabout us, Kotorin, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:52.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm... Kotorin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:57.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why'd you use me as a model\Nwithout my permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:13:00.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean, remember when you \Ncame to the club room last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:01.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your club room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:05.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, that was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:09.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since then we've apponited Kotorin \Nas an honorary member.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:10.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, I never asked for—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, don't be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:14.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We started planning afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:16.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and this project took a year and a half!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:16.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:21.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing? It's a masterpiece! \NAnd you were chosen for the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:24.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're invited to the advanced \Nscreening, of course! Be sure to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:38.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, you life sure is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:45.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry about the delay. Please, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:48.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:50.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:07.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, this is pretty crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Man, I'm psyched!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:10.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey there, Kotorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:16.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Because it sounds hillarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Aoki, the director \Nof Tennis Goddess Kotorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:24.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hope you all enjoy the movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Roll it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:34.98,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Tennis Goddess Kotorin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:49.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Planet Naoki belongs to me, Matsumotole'!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:53.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But then, appearing from out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:56.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm from the Romance system, Planet 30-Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tennis Goddess Kotorin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:04.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You won't beat me! Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:14.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She was all talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:18.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Overlord Sudoza!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:23.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I will avenge my beloved, Matsumotle'!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:53.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, to finish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:03.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Rest easy, Kotorin. Everything \Nwill be fine, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:07.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That voice... Iri—eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:13.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We are the Galaxy Guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The Three Smashketeers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:17.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here we come, Sudoza!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Penlight Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:34.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:48.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And thus, peace continued on Planet Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:53.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,All's well that ends well! Wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:58.16,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,End
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:08.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I haven't laughed like that in a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie was cracking up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:17.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Satomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:18.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's this ring for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:20.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:26.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to hide it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:27.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:29.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:36.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was kinda hard to broach the subject, \Nwith your whole one-sided romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:39.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were worried about nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:41.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, Jinko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:42.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:44.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:50.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've... both...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:53.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:56.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course not. How could I be angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:58.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:02.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now I'm the only one who's single.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:12.57,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Winter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:34.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Both of them quit their jobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:35.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:38.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie mentioned focusing on school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then Matsumoto used the same excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:43.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Manager, I'm sorry. So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:45.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:58.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:00.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, you quit your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:05.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's a pretty complicated book.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:10.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The kind of stuff you could never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:15.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cells?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:16.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Metabolite?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:18.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:22.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you going to be a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:27.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What makes you ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is a book about medicine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:30.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's talking about cells and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:31.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've got only one of those, for a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I make a point to read up on \Nthings I'm not familiar with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:35.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:38.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Becoming a doctor isn't that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:40.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd have to pass an exam to \Ntransfer to the medical school...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie in a white coat...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:45.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That'd be so dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:46.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pay attention when someone's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:51.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:55.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your Christmas dates fell through?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:57.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:00.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He said he had to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:02.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That it was more important, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:04.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What about you, Jinko?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:05.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They have a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:08.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is him. He's in a band.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:12.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:13.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, they're not signed or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:15.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But he's the vocalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:18.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, he's playing a show during Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:20.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why not go see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The show is in Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't have that kinda money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:27.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't make the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:29.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The three of us
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:34.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,will have to spend the \NChristmas by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:40.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then... why don't the three of us \Nhave a Christmas ladies night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's a nice dress. Very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:00.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You look very handsome, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:06.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd love to take your hand, \Nand dance with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.29,0:21:09.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:12.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,only if you were attending the \NPANDAI Christmas Dinner Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.21,0:21:18.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aren't you and your \Nfriends having a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:22.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wouldn't abandon \Nfriendship for romance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:30.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a shame you can't come with us, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.19,0:21:33.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say hello to Satomi and Jinko for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:34.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:37.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We might be home late, \Nso don't forget to lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:38.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.69,0:21:40.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then, we're leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.50,0:21:50.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you later,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:54.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:13.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:38.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:40.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:42.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I won't be coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:43.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You won't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:45.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The flight was cancelled \Nbecause of the heavy snow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:47.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so he can't make the concert...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:48.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:54.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Let's spend Christmas together," he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:56.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.86,0:22:57.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.69,0:23:01.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let me pick romance this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.19,0:23:04.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:05.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:08.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am so grateful! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:11.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And say sorry to Satomi for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:44.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hello, Irie residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:46.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:53.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He was lying about having work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.54,0:23:54.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He was?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:56.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He was getting a surprise ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.71,0:23:59.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He reserved dinner at the \NRoyal Hotel a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.71,0:24:01.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:03.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.55,0:24:05.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You understand, right, Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.51,0:24:08.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Getting to spend Christmas Eve \Nwith the guy I like!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.97,0:24:12.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, please, just this once. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:16.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah. It is your first \NChristmas together, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:17.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.98,0:24:22.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks. And tell Jinko I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.15,0:24:23.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.90,0:24:26.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,OK. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.99,0:25:11.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A lonely Christmas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.73,0:25:45.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.23,0:25:46.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, it's our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.40,0:25:47.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.61,0:25:49.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.99,0:25:55.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was invited today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.95,0:25:57.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.33,0:25:59.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Through my father's comapny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.08,0:26:01.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They apparently bought a lot of PANDAI stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.29,0:26:08.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, will you be working at \NPANDAI when you graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:09.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.46,0:26:10.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.05,0:26:13.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.97,0:26:18.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to introduce you to our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:20.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is the president of Hokueisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.27,0:26:24.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Oizumi from Hokueisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.44,0:26:26.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is his granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.07,0:26:29.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Sahoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.24,0:26:31.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.44,0:26:32.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.57,0:26:33.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's an honor to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:36.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm very happy to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:42.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,President Irie brags about\Nyou all the time, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.12,0:26:49.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I have to say, he's everything you \Nmade him out to be, President Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.84,0:26:51.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.55,0:26:54.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.01,0:26:55.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Certainly. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.01,0:26:56.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.93,0:26:57.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.73,0:27:06.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.81,0:27:08.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,may I have a word with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.90,0:27:09.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.25,0:27:24.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You know how I feel about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.42,0:27:28.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to know where you really stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.25,0:27:30.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.71,0:27:35.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't see us being more than friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.01,0:27:41.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.31,0:27:44.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love you, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:27:58.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.03,0:28:02.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:04.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But that's not how I see you, Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.79,0:28:06.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.33,0:28:08.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.88,0:28:13.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But my feelings won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:22.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Spending the Christmas Eve \Nwith Chibi is okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:25.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But I think I'd still...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.02,0:28:28.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You look like you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.27,0:28:30.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.11,0:28:33.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.32,0:28:34.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What about the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.11,0:28:37.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Meeting and greeting all \Nthe important guests got old,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.15,0:28:38.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so I escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.53,0:28:40.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.07,0:28:41.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.03,0:28:43.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What happened to your girls night?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.24,0:28:48.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, Satomi and Jinko ended up getting \Nto spend Christmas with their boyfriends after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.87,0:28:50.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, here I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.63,0:28:52.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A party of one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.04,0:28:54.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.05,0:28:58.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have to say, female friendship leaves a lot to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:03.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I brought a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.94,0:29:13.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is this from the hotel buffet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:15.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.53,0:29:17.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.03,0:29:21.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.99,0:29:24.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, that's for Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.83,0:29:28.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I had them prepare it without \Nseasoning, for a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.71,0:29:34.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Granted, you could probably \Neat it with a little sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:38.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.46,0:29:42.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you come back... to have dinner with Chibi?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.05,0:29:42.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.39,0:29:46.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I thought I'd spend a quiet \NChristmas with Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:53.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.52,0:29:56.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.03,0:29:58.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll go grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.11,0:30:00.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Every year, the eagerness never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.49,0:30:08.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here. This is your Christmas gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.58,0:30:15.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't worry about getting me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.38,0:30:17.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good, because I didn't intend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.92,0:30:22.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You don't have to use it, \Nif you don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:28.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Especially since you already have \Na much fancier watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.44,0:30:33.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.69,0:30:38.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.11,0:30:41.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll go buy a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.44,0:30:44.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Can't have Christmas without a cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.03,0:30:48.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There is a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.16,0:30:50.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:52.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's besides the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.92,0:31:00.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why's there a cake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.84,0:31:02.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.51,0:31:12.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Were you... going to eat this with Chibi, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.27,0:31:14.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.49,0:31:34.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My piece doesn't need to be very big.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.79,0:31:35.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.04,0:31:39.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You can have a piece with Santa on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.80,0:31:52.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Santa Claus, thank you for giving me \Nthe present I most wanted this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.74,0:32:12.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.58,0:32:18.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't believe we made \Nyou spend Christmas alone...!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.42,0:32:20.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.67,0:32:23.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was really lonely, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.46,0:32:27.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.76,0:32:32.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can forgive you, because I'm so generous!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.27,0:32:40.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, we can at least spend \NNew Year's Eve together!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.86,0:32:44.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's start the New Year together!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:44.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.69,0:32:47.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.57,0:32:53.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.20,0:32:54.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.56,0:33:24.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.82,0:33:26.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.32,0:33:29.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've been out late a lot, recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.49,0:33:33.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The end of the fiscal \Nyear's coming up, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:36.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you need dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.12,0:33:38.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nah, I ate already.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.75,0:33:41.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Think I'll wash up and go to bed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.67,0:33:44.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't work too hard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.63,0:33:46.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your health is most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.63,0:33:48.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.81,0:33:57.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.52,0:34:04.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Next time you see Naoki, tell him it'd be nice \Nif he came over for Sunday dinner once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.90,0:34:06.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.94,0:34:07.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.55,0:34:36.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:43.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.98,0:34:47.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What did you need at the student affairs office?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.77,0:34:49.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.32,0:34:53.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But you seemed even \Nmore serious than usual...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.82,0:34:55.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going to the library. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.28,0:34:59.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hang on! Your dad wanted me \Nto tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.41,0:35:00.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.37,0:35:04.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He asked you to come home \Nfor a meal this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:05.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.33,0:35:09.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think he's worn out from \Nworking a lot of extra hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.17,0:35:13.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He seems to want to discuss \Nsomething with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.67,0:35:14.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.60,0:35:19.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My future?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.85,0:35:20.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.27,0:35:24.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's been about a year since \Nyou moved out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.73,0:35:28.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you're going to be a \Nsophmore this spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.65,0:35:32.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You must have made some \Nplans for your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.57,0:35:36.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.37,0:35:39.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know what I'd like, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.99,0:35:40.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.58,0:35:44.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For you to take over the company for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.71,0:35:48.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Start out as my right hand man,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:53.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and eventually, use your own strengths \Nto make the business grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.72,0:35:56.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's is my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.89,0:36:00.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.47,0:36:01.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you really curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.93,0:36:03.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Or are you asking me if I'll do what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.64,0:36:09.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You kept having me introduce myself \Nto your business partners at the banquet...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.19,0:36:11.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're trying to raise my \Nprofile beforehand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.82,0:36:15.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.65,0:36:19.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's only doing this out \Nof concern for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.28,0:36:20.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This isn't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.49,0:36:22.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's worried about himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.04,0:36:24.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're the same way, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.33,0:36:25.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Eh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.75,0:36:28.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, just because you like Kotoko yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.42,0:36:30.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You didn't consider my feelings, \Nand kept pushing us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.17,0:36:35.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I just thought you'd be a great couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.17,0:36:37.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please, enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.93,0:36:40.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Having my parents dictate \Nmy career, and my love life...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.25,0:37:10.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.12,0:37:11.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thought that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.29,0:37:18.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He liked Kotoko, deep\N down, this whole time...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.67,0:37:19.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.47,0:37:23.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was just pushing my feelings on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.10,0:37:27.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and I've put them both \Nthrough so much for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.64,0:37:28.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.44,0:37:30.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He likes her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.94,0:37:36.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki does like Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.69,0:37:39.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, don't cry, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.99,0:37:41.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki...?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.53,0:37:43.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.16,0:37:45.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you know something? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.83,0:37:49.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.08,0:37:50.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.29,0:37:54.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.04,0:37:56.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.63,0:38:04.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, y'know, you never talk that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.14,0:38:07.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so, I think maybe, as far \Nas your future goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.19,0:38:13.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.94,0:38:18.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's the first job I've been \Ninterested in doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.86,0:38:20.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you changing schools?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.95,0:38:21.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.45,0:38:25.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's an exam for Tonan's medical school, \Nand I'm taking it to transfer over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.62,0:38:28.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So that's why you were at Academic Affairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.70,0:38:29.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To do the paperwork?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.37,0:38:34.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you tell them earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.63,0:38:36.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not the time to tell yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.29,0:38:40.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then why tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.68,0:38:50.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone else, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.70,0:39:06.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about we both have \Na drink? It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.62,0:39:08.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh... that sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.12,0:39:14.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sighing like that doesn't suit you, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.67,0:39:20.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean... Yuki wouldn't spill the beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.80,0:39:23.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And Naoki's always been so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.09,0:39:25.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So it's hard to tell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.97,0:39:31.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would it kill him to just talk to his parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.06,0:39:37.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Boys are all like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.56,0:39:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.15,0:39:40.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.66,0:39:47.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.16,0:39:48.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.25,0:39:56.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm heading to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.42,0:39:57.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah! Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.63,0:40:00.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.92,0:40:01.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come here for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.84,0:40:02.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.13,0:40:08.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.99,0:40:29.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The Progress of Modern Medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.32,0:40:31.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.62,0:40:32.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.41,0:40:35.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's... not like I...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.00,0:40:37.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was just thinking if I become a nurse...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.25,0:40:40.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten what \Nthe F in class F means?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.17,0:40:42.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.05,0:40:47.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations on getting a \Nperfect score your entrance exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.26,0:40:50.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I actually studied for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.05,0:40:51.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to get any other score.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.89,0:40:54.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.47,0:40:56.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.02,0:41:00.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He wants to treat you to dinner, and \Nsaid to come to Puffer House whenever.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.78,0:41:10.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.70,0:41:12.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Naoki! Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.95,0:41:15.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You came right after getting \Nmy invite! I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.49,0:41:16.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.45,0:41:19.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Living alone, I've been mostly \Neating pretty simple meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.58,0:41:20.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.46,0:41:23.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.42,0:41:24.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where's Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.55,0:41:25.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.96,0:41:28.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Getting to have the Boss' \Ncooking all to yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.80,0:41:31.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wold you rather she had come \Nwith me? On my arm, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.55,0:41:33.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nah, bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.18,0:41:36.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinnosuke, quit your yapping. \NGet back to work, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.93,0:41:37.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.27,0:41:41.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:43.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got a private room, \Nlet's chat in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.61,0:41:44.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.23,0:41:47.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.78,0:41:49.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The broth is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.32,0:41:51.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.99,0:41:52.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.82,0:41:54.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.03,0:41:57.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The soup stock tastes like that \Nthanks to the puffer fish itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.95,0:42:01.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We also take special care with the \Nquality of the kelp and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.92,0:42:03.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess the ingredients are the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.21,0:42:06.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The choosing of ingredients
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.96,0:42:09.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,is what shows your \Nability as a chef, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.97,0:42:14.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,By the way, Naoki,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.43,0:42:17.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,we're going to be closing in another hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.06,0:42:19.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,After you finish eating,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.43,0:42:21.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.27,0:42:23.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.69,0:42:29.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You got married when you were 20?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.45,0:42:34.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was still learning the \Nropes at a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.57,0:42:36.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Back then, I really busted \Nmy butt, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.20,0:42:39.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you always want to be a chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.83,0:42:40.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.83,0:42:44.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Having someone eat your cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.08,0:42:46.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and say it's good always made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.46,0:42:49.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You built Puffer House from nothing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.96,0:42:50.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.63,0:42:55.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Talking with you about this stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.05,0:42:58.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,reminds me of when your dad and I had the same conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.89,0:43:00.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You and dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.06,0:43:02.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yep. See, your dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.52,0:43:07.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,His dad—that is to say, your grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.23,0:43:09.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,His company was still middle-sized back then
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.15,0:43:14.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but he had plans for it to \Ngrow bigger, even back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.12,0:43:16.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.70,0:43:20.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He actually made it happen, \Nwhich is a hell of a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.91,0:43:25.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I figure, Iri's next dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:28.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is about your future, Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.13,0:43:30.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My future?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.17,0:43:34.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He thinks really highly of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.64,0:43:41.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But since he doesn't see you every day anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.81,0:43:43.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think he misses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.23,0:43:49.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your future is important, \Ndon't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.86,0:43:52.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but you gotta look after your parents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.90,0:43:54.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.32,0:43:56.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.17,0:44:11.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Medical school!?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.21,0:44:12.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry for keeping it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.88,0:44:16.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I thought a lot about whether or \Nnot I should take over your comapny...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.63,0:44:18.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That was my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.72,0:44:22.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But... I know that it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.85,0:44:26.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to be like you and Mr. Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.85,0:44:29.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to spend my life working \Non something of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.98,0:44:31.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.03,0:44:34.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.49,0:44:38.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm not taking over the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.20,0:44:41.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nao—
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.04,0:44:43.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.62,0:44:45.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:47.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.50,0:44:50.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Where does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.25,0:44:52.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ch-chest... my chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.25,0:44:54.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's the heart. Call an ambulance, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.34,0:44:55.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A-ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.51,0:44:57.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Papa, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.76,0:44:59.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki, get a blanket!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.18,0:45:00.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.68,0:45:00.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A...am-ambu...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.18,0:45:01.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll call them!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.06,0:45:03.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.31,0:45:06.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Honey, please hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.81,0:45:09.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We need an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.11,0:45:21.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a bit of angina.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.41,0:45:25.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's past the critical period,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.33,0:45:27.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so his life won't be in any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.46,0:45:29.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.58,0:45:31.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,if he overworks himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.42,0:45:34.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,it could turn into a full blown heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.38,0:45:35.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That'd mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.59,0:45:37.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He'd need surgery on his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.63,0:45:38.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.59,0:45:44.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He needs to take some time \Noff work, and get plenty of rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.91,0:46:05.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry to trouble you when you're busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.03,0:46:06.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.21,0:46:18.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who were the people in the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.51,0:46:22.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Executive staff and business partners...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.22,0:46:25.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry for interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.80,0:46:28.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Suzuki Trading's president \Nand executive director are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.35,0:46:29.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, it's good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.52,0:46:31.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.69,0:46:33.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mrs. Irie, it's not much, but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.56,0:46:36.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.23,0:46:37.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.19,0:46:39.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hate to bring it up at \Na time like this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.28,0:46:43.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you about \Nwhat were discussing the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.74,0:46:41.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.70,0:46:45.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.66,0:46:49.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, it's going smoothly at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.96,0:46:58.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad needs actual rest, or he could \Nend up dead from a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.38,0:47:00.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.46,0:47:03.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You know you father. \NHe's really dilligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.55,0:47:06.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He likes to have a hand in everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.14,0:47:10.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Which is probably why \Nhe has so much stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.52,0:47:16.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.19,0:47:19.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just bad about making you \Nworried like this, Tsuchiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.44,0:47:21.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,By the way, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.94,0:47:25.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Our accounting for this \Nperiod is looking really tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.99,0:47:27.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so I was hoping to ask you \Nabout the stock dividends...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.70,0:47:29.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.16,0:47:31.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but my father really needs rest right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.62,0:47:35.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll handle business matters as \Nacting president in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.71,0:47:37.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That work for you, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.96,0:47:41.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really, Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.09,0:47:44.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,One thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.22,0:47:47.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,this is a limited time thing, \Nuntil you're back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:53.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you, Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.64,0:47:56.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just get your rest, and feel better, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.94,0:47:58.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.23,0:48:01.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tsuchiya,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.94,0:48:04.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to ask you to look \Nafter Naoki for me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.95,0:48:05.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.33,0:48:17.29,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,The 3rd year on campus
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.58,0:48:20.92,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.25,0:48:23.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Irie's in the hospital?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.30,0:48:25.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That sounds like a pretty \Nmessed up spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.92,0:48:27.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.26,0:48:28.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, y'know,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.26,0:48:30.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie moved back in!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.93,0:48:32.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.06,0:48:32.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.76,0:48:36.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I'm thinking about \Ntaking over the housework!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.58,0:48:55.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To be blunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.08,0:48:57.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,if we don't do something, \Nit's going ot be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.71,0:48:58.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Executive Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.17,0:49:00.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.21,0:49:02.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,With the sudden shift in the \Nexchange rate lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.54,0:49:04.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,we're going to need immediate \Nfinancial support,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.80,0:49:07.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,or it'll be hard to keep operating.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.76,0:49:50.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.05,0:49:52.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you just get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.64,0:49:53.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.10,0:49:57.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're working at your dad's \Ncompany starting today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.27,0:49:59.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will you be working late every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.69,0:50:02.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.36,0:50:06.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do, \Njust let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.15,0:50:08.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.24,0:50:16.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well... good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.12,0:50:20.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad's not doing too well...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.92,0:50:25.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,His heart's got it's problems, \Nbut his liver's not doing well, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.00,0:50:27.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And he also has diabetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.55,0:50:32.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A full recovery will take a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.93,0:50:37.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If I want dad to get better...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.64,0:50:41.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I have to take the company over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.69,0:50:43.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.65,0:50:44.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.94,0:50:46.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What about your dream of becoming a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.07,0:50:49.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, it hasn't been my dream for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.15,0:50:55.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I plan to take some time off from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.20,0:50:57.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.62,0:51:08.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seeing him look as sad as he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.17,0:51:10.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but hug him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.26,0:51:12.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.30,0:51:16.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He didn't push me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.64,0:51:22.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have you got your wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.93,0:51:23.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:24.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And your handkerchief?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.56,0:51:25.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.15,0:51:27.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then that just leaves this!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.61,0:51:29.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't need lunch. \NI can eat at the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.90,0:51:30.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.94,0:51:33.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I made this with special consideration \Nfor nutritional balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.82,0:51:36.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There're the usual tamagoyaki, \Nalong with some negiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.82,0:51:38.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,...Green onion pancakes, in a lunch box?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.28,0:51:40.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be brain food!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.08,0:51:42.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then you should probably eat it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.04,0:51:44.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You don't have to eat it all, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.41,0:51:45.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.00,0:51:51.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.22,0:51:56.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A safe trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.34,0:51:59.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were about to say "darling", weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.14,0:52:03.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How's your condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.18,0:52:06.23,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.64,0:52:06.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've been in the hospital \Nfor almost three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.06,0:52:09.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks to Naoki, \NI've gotten plenty of rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.77,0:52:12.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm getting better a bit at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.19,0:52:13.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.07,0:52:14.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.90,0:52:16.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.07,0:52:18.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,must be great having such a talented kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.28,0:52:19.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.99,0:52:22.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And Kotoko's been doing \Nall the house work lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.99,0:52:26.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I can focus on looking after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.79,0:52:30.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Must be great, having such \Na talented kid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.17,0:52:31.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm also flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.59,0:52:32.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't read too much into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.46,0:52:34.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.84,0:52:38.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're probably busy between the \Nhouse and school, right? Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.51,0:52:40.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not a problem at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.39,0:52:42.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Besides, summer vacation \Nis starting next week,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.76,0:52:44.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and I'll have more free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.27,0:52:47.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Free time...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.02,0:52:51.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uncle, I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.70,0:53:00.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everyone, let me introduce \Nour new part-time colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.99,0:53:06.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Kotoko Aihara. From \Nerrands to odd jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.20,0:53:09.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll get it done. It's a \Npleasure to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.25,0:53:14.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And joining her will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.05,0:53:20.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuko Matsumoto. I've got \Nlevel 1 English certification.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.01,0:53:21.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Along with assitant certificaiton.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.30,0:53:24.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can do basically anything, \Nso just let me know what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.36,0:53:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.61,0:53:37.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're after Irie, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.74,0:53:39.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How'd you manage getting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.03,0:53:41.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My father is a shareholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.32,0:53:42.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I had the connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.07,0:53:44.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, you used a dirty trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.83,0:53:46.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And so did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.33,0:53:49.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi, Yuko-san.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.62,0:53:50.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi, Mr. Burns.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.87,0:53:52.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need a meeting room. \NIs there one available?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.75,0:53:56.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think... meeting room C is available.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.09,0:53:57.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}How many people will join you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.42,0:53:58.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, uh, six.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.72,0:54:00.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sure.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.18,0:54:00.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.80,0:54:01.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}My pleasure.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.01,0:54:02.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.89,0:54:03.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.06,0:54:11.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.77,0:54:16.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Start.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.99,0:54:21.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the? Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.57,0:54:24.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.66,0:54:27.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.33,0:54:28.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why don't you get some tea ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.25,0:54:30.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.72,0:54:47.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,President Irie must be pretty relieved
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.14,0:54:53.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,to have such a capable successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.60,0:55:00.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm jealous he had such a \Ntalented individual to call on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.03,0:55:03.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.91,0:55:09.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This matter is related to \Nour future cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.95,0:55:15.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you remember my granddaughter, Sahoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.17,0:55:16.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.21,0:55:18.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I never forget a beautiful face.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.00,0:55:20.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How would you feel about marrying her?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.46,0:55:22.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.55,0:55:24.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.68,0:55:26.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hurry and clean that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.47,0:55:27.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And Matsumoto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.51,0:55:29.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your dad helped me get a job...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.97,0:55:31.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.31,0:55:33.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Try and not get in my way, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.31,0:55:34.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.81,0:55:36.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Damned dunce...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.94,0:55:39.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.19,0:55:40.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We are so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.28,0:55:42.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ah, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.07,0:55:44.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Both of you, that's enough, head on back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.28,0:55:45.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.33,0:55:54.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, thanks to you, \Nthey think I'm a klutz too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.79,0:55:57.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But he brought up \Nmarriage, out of the blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.96,0:55:59.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was shocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.25,0:56:02.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's what they call a strategic marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.67,0:56:03.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,S-strategic?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.92,0:56:04.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.17,0:56:10.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know that girl, the granddaughter \Nof President Oizumi, Sahoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.10,0:56:11.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.51,0:56:14.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,At the PANDAI Company \NChristmas Party last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.10,0:56:16.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I attended with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.81,0:56:19.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I saw Irie greeting the Oizumis.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.48,0:56:21.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was watching nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.19,0:56:23.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.44,0:56:25.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.20,0:56:28.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She fell in love with Irie at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.32,0:56:29.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.20,0:56:32.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's what my woman's intuition tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.91,0:56:34.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I could tell it from her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.37,0:56:36.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.29,0:56:38.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.92,0:56:41.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What does "strategic" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.38,0:56:43.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're as dense as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.46,0:56:45.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.72,0:56:52.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,PANDAI is in trouble, and could use the financial support \Nof the Hokueisha Group, that President Ohizumi runs....
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.31,0:56:54.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, if Irie marries Sahoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.35,0:56:56.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.44,0:56:58.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.77,0:57:02.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Isn't your family also a shareholder of PANDAI?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.73,0:57:08.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, couldn't you set up a business \Nmarriage, like Sahoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.82,0:57:10.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.07,0:57:12.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That was a good idea for me, \Nif maybe not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.58,0:57:15.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.08,0:57:18.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't want to use my parents’ influence
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.33,0:57:20.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,to be with someone I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.09,0:57:23.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Miss Aihara,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.84,0:57:27.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let me know if you see any signs \Nabout Irie accepting this proposition, either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.34,0:57:30.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even I know when I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.82,0:57:44.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.90,0:57:50.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You have visitors, claiming to be \N schoolmates of yours, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.78,0:57:51.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.99,0:57:54.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.70,0:58:00.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To think that the Irie who \Nour Kotorin fell in love with
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.04,0:58:02.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,is the acting president of PANDAI!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.46,0:58:04.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That came as a total shock to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.09,0:58:07.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, we want to present you \Nwith the sure-fire hit proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.42,0:58:10.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,that we at the Anime Club \Nof Tonan U came up with!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.80,0:58:12.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Curious? Wanna hear more?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.64,0:58:13.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.51,0:58:16.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.39,0:58:18.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.27,0:58:21.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since we made it all the way here, \Nwe may as well show you. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.44,0:58:26.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.86,0:58:29.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The Kotorin doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.82,0:58:32.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well? Are we looking at a\N big seller, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.49,0:58:35.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This company deals in the \Nhopes and dreams of children.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.37,0:58:36.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That design... doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.41,0:58:39.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will you please leave, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.83,0:58:41.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alas...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.25,0:58:49.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.34,0:58:52.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Short of funds?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.22,0:58:54.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.09,0:58:58.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We need specific orders, \Nacting president.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.81,0:59:03.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've actually got a plan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.77,0:59:08.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.11,0:59:09.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Eat all you want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.57,0:59:16.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So salty! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.37,0:59:17.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Grilled yellowtail...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.83,0:59:20.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wouldn't touch it! It's nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.87,0:59:26.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki? What was that crunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.17,0:59:27.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The taro root...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.63,0:59:30.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's undercooked! You should spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.63,0:59:33.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.17,0:59:34.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.47,0:59:36.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't be such a whiner. Eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.90,0:59:55.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.41,0:59:58.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A business marriage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.16,1:00:01.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,With the granddaughter \Nof President Ohizumi?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.20,1:00:03.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.16,1:00:05.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll make the decision myself, either way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.12,1:00:06.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.71,1:00:09.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"If I sacrifice my own freedom, I can save the company!"
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.96,1:00:11.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You sure this isn't some kind of martyr act?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.88,1:00:12.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How could it be?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.59,1:00:14.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be honest, then:
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.17,1:00:16.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sahoko is exactly my type of girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.80,1:00:18.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She is?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.51,1:00:21.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes. I was interested in her \Nthe moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.39,1:00:22.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you satisfied, now?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.39,1:00:25.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Usually a parent attends \None of these types of meetings.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.40,1:00:36.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.20,1:00:38.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Auntie...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.74,1:00:42.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.16,1:00:45.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I won't let this happen!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.83,1:00:48.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I promise! I super promise!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.42,1:00:54.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.46,1:00:57.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.93,1:01:01.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going to attend their little date,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.93,1:01:03.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and I will completely destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.72,1:01:05.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Destroy...?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.14,1:01:11.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Look, I want my son to be happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.19,1:01:15.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Which is why he needs to end up with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.94,1:01:18.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It can only be you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.61,1:01:20.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Auntie...!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.57,1:01:23.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For the sake of Naoki's happiness,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.74,1:01:25.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We have to sabotage this arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.95,1:01:27.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.29,1:01:32.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.84,1:01:35.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Arranged marriage?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.00,1:01:36.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.09,1:01:38.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think that Irie
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.84,1:01:41.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,is willing to sacrifice \Nhimself for the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.18,1:01:47.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So his mom and I are planning \Nto ruin the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.27,1:01:51.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We call it: Operation Arranged Sabotage!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.48,1:01:54.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You two are still up to \Nthe same old tricks, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.61,1:01:57.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine! This time it's justified.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.03,1:01:59.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.78,1:02:01.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Because this time
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.95,1:02:04.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be backing you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.54,1:02:11.46,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Autumn
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.04,1:02:11.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.92,1:02:13.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sahoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.92,1:02:17.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This isn't technically \Nyour first meeting,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.01,1:02:21.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but I'm an old fashioned person.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.34,1:02:26.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I still want a formal meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.76,1:02:30.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, I arranged this get-together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.81,1:02:31.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That being the case,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.40,1:02:35.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,let's get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.57,1:02:45.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why exactly am I dressed like this, again?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.53,1:02:48.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you want to avoid suspicion \Nwhile sneaking around a garden,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.20,1:02:50.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you dress like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.04,1:02:53.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sahoko, do you have any hobbies?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.25,1:02:56.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes. Crafts, and cooking...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.88,1:02:59.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I only know what my mother \Ntaught me, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.34,1:03:03.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really? Your hobbies seem \Nso common and boring!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.60,1:03:09.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're a student at Shokaku \NWomen's University, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.89,1:03:10.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.98,1:03:13.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And your grades are also outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.14,1:03:14.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're so kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.35,1:03:16.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Something you can say about Sahoko
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.31,1:03:19.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,is that she's a traditional Japanese \Nwoman, living in modern times.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.15,1:03:22.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's a very demure girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.24,1:03:27.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I {\i1}thought{\i0} she was lacking \Nin youthful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.83,1:03:32.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pretty, domestic, and talented.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.25,1:03:34.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.88,1:03:39.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you have any hobbies, Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.75,1:03:41.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mostly reading, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.59,1:03:43.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My favorite writer is Gide.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.80,1:03:48.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki's also won national \Ntennis tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.43,1:03:51.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Such a well-rounded young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.39,1:03:56.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh! That's wonderful. Maybe you \Ncan have him teach you tennis.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.44,1:04:00.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right. I've always had \Ntrouble with tennis...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.19,1:04:01.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to teach me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.23,1:04:06.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Teaching someone incapable of \Nimproving is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.78,1:04:08.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.16,1:04:10.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I should introduce our situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.37,1:04:14.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's a girl at home who's \Nthe same age as Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.16,1:04:17.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They've been living together!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.54,1:04:19.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Living together?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.21,1:04:21.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We live in the same \Nhouse, not together.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.42,1:04:24.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's no difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.88,1:04:27.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They've spent the night \Ntogether for more than once.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.84,1:04:31.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,After all, they are both very young.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.31,1:04:33.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nobody knows what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.14,1:04:38.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sahoko, let's go out for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.69,1:04:39.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.07,1:04:44.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, are you going to the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.49,1:04:47.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, I was still...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.03,1:04:48.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:50.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's continue our conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.66,1:04:58.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I apologize for my mother \Nbringing up that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.29,1:05:00.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.58,1:05:02.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your mother must adore
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.29,1:05:05.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,the girl living in your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.67,1:05:07.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, {\i1}she{\i0} does.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.01,1:05:11.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wonder if she'll like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.43,1:05:14.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That doesn't really matter, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.60,1:05:16.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,As long as I like you, isn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.41,1:05:32.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.32,1:05:34.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This isn't looking good!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.03,1:05:35.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Miss Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.20,1:05:37.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's time for Phase 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.12,1:05:39.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.58,1:05:40.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.58,1:05:43.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See how there are sprinklers over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.17,1:05:45.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When they pass it, we turn the water on,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.71,1:05:48.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and soak that kimono she's wearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.22,1:05:50.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then she will have to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.55,1:05:52.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How childish.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.51,1:05:54.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think I understand why you \Nhave so much trouble with Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.18,1:05:58.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.19,1:06:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.15,1:06:06.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ready and...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.28,1:06:16.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The water isn't coming out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.99,1:06:17.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.16,1:06:19.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's weird...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.79,1:06:21.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They've passed by.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.58,1:06:25.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's weird! It worked \Nperfectly in rehearsal!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.14,1:06:35.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why didn't it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.72,1:06:37.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.31,1:06:44.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.69,1:06:47.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A sprinkler malfunction, probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.03,1:06:49.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.53,1:06:50.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.36,1:06:52.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.66,1:07:00.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That was pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.62,1:07:03.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was nothing! Time for Phase 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.25,1:07:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.17,1:07:09.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.30,1:07:10.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a gecko!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.46,1:07:11.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it for?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.88,1:07:14.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When she's on that bridge,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.30,1:07:16.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,we throw the gecko at her!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.89,1:07:18.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then, she'll be shocked!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.81,1:07:21.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She'll scream! And flop right into the pond.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.73,1:07:23.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And will have to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.85,1:07:25.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,These are all kid's pranks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.94,1:07:27.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you think it's going too far?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.57,1:07:31.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's fine. She deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.04,1:07:43.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here they come. Toss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.88,1:07:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.30,1:07:59.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.60,1:08:07.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.40,1:08:09.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I did something terrible...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.15,1:08:11.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And got punished for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.32,1:08:13.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.53,1:08:17.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sure my "monster mother-in-law" \Nplan was quite successful.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.32,1:08:20.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet they'll break off the arrangement!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.87,1:08:24.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.38,1:08:40.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for how unpleasant \Nthe other day was.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.72,1:08:44.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was quite an unforgettable experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.48,1:08:47.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:51.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For better or worse,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.86,1:08:55.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,as long as I can experience it \Nwith you, It will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.70,1:08:57.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That suits me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.20,1:09:00.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll protect you from the worst of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.22,1:09:22.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you know what time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.60,1:09:25.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,11:23PM.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.81,1:09:27.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where have you been? And with whom?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.56,1:09:29.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm not a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.10,1:09:30.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm free to do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.65,1:09:32.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you go on a date?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.48,1:09:34.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.02,1:09:35.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you want to sabotage it again?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.98,1:09:37.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,While carrying a broom...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.41,1:09:42.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You should find a good man yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.33,1:09:45.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.08,1:09:49.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.67,1:09:52.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't stomp up the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.92,1:09:58.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stuff like that is why my brother went \Nfor the old fashioned beauty instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.93,1:10:01.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.77,1:10:13.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.06,1:10:15.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're still up?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.53,1:10:18.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Go to bed already.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.17,1:10:36.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, are you gonna marry\Nthat lady you're seeing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.00,1:10:37.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Very possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.30,1:10:40.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you like her?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.13,1:10:42.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why suddenly ask these questions?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.76,1:10:44.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.09,1:10:49.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean... I know you like Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.28,1:11:07.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.08,1:11:08.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I’ll play a joke on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.83,1:11:13.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.71,1:12:02.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Another one?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.31,1:12:16.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A dream...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.25,1:12:39.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.88,1:12:42.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sahoko is pretty and smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.34,1:12:45.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You like girls like that \Ntoo, don't you, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.59,1:12:47.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.22,1:12:51.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Satomi, Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.68,1:12:52.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.68,1:12:56.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You look toasty! Where were \Nyou during summer?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.31,1:12:57.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I went to Guam.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.10,1:12:58.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What're you, rich?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.40,1:13:00.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My boyfriend paid all the expenses.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.23,1:13:01.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.02,1:13:03.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What about you, Jinko, \Nwhere'd you get that tan?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.78,1:13:06.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,From outdoor musical \Nfestivals, with my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.40,1:13:07.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.28,1:13:09.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,'Morning...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.49,1:13:15.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Kotoko, you look like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.54,1:13:17.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did Irie shoot you down again?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.25,1:13:19.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.79,1:13:21.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,is going to be engaged soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.88,1:13:24.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Engaged?!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.05,1:13:27.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.55,1:13:30.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So things are already that advanced...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.09,1:13:32.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess you have to give up, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.35,1:13:36.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come, eat some cake. \NPull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.48,1:13:38.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Today, it's our treat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.14,1:13:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.98,1:13:41.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.77,1:13:45.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then we go have fun \Nand find you a better man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.94,1:13:47.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You got a better man right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.32,1:13:53.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.78,1:13:56.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here. Right here! The one I'm pointing at!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.62,1:14:00.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinnosuke, would you buzz off?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.25,1:14:01.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.08,1:14:04.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, I heard it from the boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.80,1:14:08.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You gotta forget about \Nthe iceburg already...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.51,1:14:10.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And we can go out for a date. How's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.13,1:14:11.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.55,1:14:14.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We need to find someone better than Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.56,1:14:16.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wanna go on a date?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.44,1:14:21.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.48,1:14:24.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.15,1:14:28.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.19,1:14:30.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.03,1:14:32.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not a dream. Let's go have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.83,1:14:36.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.50,1:14:40.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.00,1:14:42.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It looks like things are proceeding...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.58,1:14:44.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess we're out of options.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.38,1:14:48.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you going to give up, Matsumoto?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.63,1:14:51.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's got me beat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.72,1:14:55.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To be honest, if someone \Nwas going to take Irie from me,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.51,1:14:57.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd rather it be you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.73,1:15:02.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That Sahoko girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.10,1:15:04.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It feels like I lost without \Neven getting in the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.81,1:15:07.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But I've seen everything \Nyou've done to get with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.94,1:15:10.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If Irie chose you,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.19,1:15:12.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd be sure I could make him regret it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.53,1:15:15.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Make him wish he picked me instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.12,1:15:18.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're as confident as ever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.20,1:15:20.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I do have my pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.91,1:15:23.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.62,1:15:26.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hate the idea of thinking \Nof you as competition,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.84,1:15:29.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but it's been fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.80,1:15:31.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.42,1:15:35.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For both of us to be \Nheartbroken... What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.01,1:15:37.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You should pull yourself up together, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.47,1:15:41.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's both find wonderful boyfriends.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.89,1:15:42.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.73,1:15:51.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Miss Matsumoto...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.40,1:15:54.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She made for a nice romantic rival.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.28,1:16:00.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning , Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.54,1:16:01.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.50,1:16:03.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you want some toast?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.96,1:16:05.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You making breakfast, today?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.62,1:16:06.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.17,1:16:07.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where's Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.13,1:16:08.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She went out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.92,1:16:11.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,On a date? With who?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.09,1:16:12.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.76,1:16:14.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She dressed up nice and headed out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.90,1:16:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.82,1:16:34.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.40,1:16:36.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.61,1:16:41.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Man, you actually showed up! \NI'm touched over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.33,1:16:46.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you're even cuter than usual today!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.16,1:16:49.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you. So, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.25,1:16:50.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.63,1:16:54.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For now... you wanna hit the arcade?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.21,1:16:55.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.34,1:16:56.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.59,1:16:58.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right this way! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.14,1:17:07.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot! This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.77,1:17:10.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.73,1:17:11.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.52,1:17:12.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nice one, Kin!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.40,1:17:15.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.70,1:17:18.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.83,1:17:29.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Check this out...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.79,1:17:30.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.67,1:17:33.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.21,1:17:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.30,1:17:37.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.30,1:17:38.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.47,1:17:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gotta relax!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.85,1:17:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.49,1:18:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kin! You got a strike!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.25,1:18:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.04,1:18:16.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That was a wonderful performance.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.21,1:18:19.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes. The melody was engrossing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.76,1:18:24.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm amazed that girl next to you was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.10,1:18:26.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.40,1:18:38.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit, wake up, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.95,1:18:43.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.50,1:18:49.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.66,1:18:51.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.29,1:18:58.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so glad you agreed to this!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.00,1:19:01.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am too. Thanks for inviting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.01,1:19:02.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.26,1:19:05.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since we're here, you wanna get something?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.01,1:19:06.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.35,1:19:08.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about yakisoba? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.27,1:19:10.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There is salted yakisoba, \Nseafood yakisoba...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.64,1:19:12.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What? What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.98,1:19:16.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,On the menu! It looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.02,1:19:19.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, no it doesn't!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.11,1:19:21.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You mean like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.45,1:19:23.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.87,1:19:32.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you heading back \Nto the office after this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.12,1:19:33.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.04,1:19:35.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's a project that's underway.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.92,1:19:40.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Being able to act as president \Nof a massive company like PANDAI...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.71,1:19:44.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you're still a student. \NIt's incredibly admirable.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.01,1:19:45.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.09,1:19:47.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Student entrepreneurs are fairly common, nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.51,1:19:50.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The only difference is\N the size of the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.31,1:19:52.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.24,1:20:03.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.53,1:20:07.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wanna do this again, sometime...?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.91,1:20:09.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.87,1:20:15.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, seeya then, Kotoko! Good night!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.22,1:20:26.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Someone's in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.47,1:20:28.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.55,1:20:29.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you just get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.97,1:20:32.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yep. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.93,1:20:35.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,From how you're dressed... were you at work?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.73,1:20:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.81,1:20:41.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was thinking about having some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.52,1:20:42.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you want some?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.53,1:20:45.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I heard that you went on a date today.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.15,1:20:48.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you're back before morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.49,1:20:49.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It wasn't like that—
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.08,1:20:54.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hot! So hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.79,1:21:01.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.09,1:21:02.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To wash that down in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.18,1:21:10.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.97,1:21:12.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not bad enough for scarring.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.31,1:21:14.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.18,1:21:15.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.39,1:21:17.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take it from someone who \Nwanted to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.35,1:21:20.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.90,1:21:25.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've tried so hard to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.24,1:21:26.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.03,1:21:29.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, I'm so in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.62,1:21:39.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.54,1:21:40.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Non?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.00,1:21:42.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.42,1:21:43.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.30,1:21:46.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How's Yuki doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.09,1:21:49.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.72,1:21:51.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess it's been a whole year now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.80,1:21:53.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about you, Non?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.31,1:21:58.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's headed for a renal endoscopy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.14,1:22:01.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Non... hang in there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.23,1:22:05.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.40,1:22:10.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let this disease beat me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.70,1:22:17.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is his condition bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.91,1:22:20.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's congenital kidney disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.50,1:22:23.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He'll probably be wrestling \Nwith it for his entire life.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.34,1:22:25.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.30,1:22:26.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.59,1:22:33.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If it was you...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.18,1:22:36.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe you could find a cure for \Ndiseases that don't have one,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.22,1:22:39.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,or become a doctor, \Nand help people heal in a snap.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.27,1:22:42.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You seem like you could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.87,1:22:57.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is the business development \Nplan for our new product.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.79,1:23:00.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The game's title is \N"Tennis Goddess Kotorin".
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.21,1:23:05.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The head of development, Aoki, \Nwill now explain the game's flow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.59,1:23:08.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let me introduce the game for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.34,1:23:10.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The heroine is based on a \Nmember of the Tonan University
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.92,1:23:15.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tennis and Anime Clubs, \NMiss Kotoko Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.23,1:23:22.94,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Tennis Goddess Kotorin
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.94,1:23:28.07,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,There's lots of strong opponents in the universe!\NI've gotta get even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.07,1:23:30.94,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Celebrating Papa's recovery!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.03,1:23:30.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Iri!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.94,1:23:32.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.24,1:23:33.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.65,1:23:34.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.87,1:23:43.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nothing beats the smell of home!\NMan, am I glad to be back!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.62,1:23:46.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We put a feast together for you, Iri!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.21,1:23:48.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aw, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.09,1:23:50.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.63,1:23:52.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away \Nwolfing down greasy food, got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.59,1:23:55.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah... I got scolded!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.55,1:23:59.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll go with this, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.52,1:24:05.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your \Nrelease from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.31,1:24:07.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's nice of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.94,1:24:09.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did Naoki ask you to come?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.65,1:24:12.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's going to be \Npart of the family soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.95,1:24:20.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you Miss Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.08,1:24:22.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.29,1:24:26.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.58,1:24:28.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit, you are such a klutz.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.09,1:24:32.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.26,1:24:33.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.43,1:24:44.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.52,1:24:48.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We've gotta move out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.90,1:24:53.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.40,1:24:58.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If we stay here much longer, \Nit's gonna get weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.74,1:25:03.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know they're being considerate \Nfor you already,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.16,1:25:06.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and it's throwing a wrench \Ninto everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.29,1:25:11.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know this is rough for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.13,1:25:13.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but let's move out...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.09,1:25:18.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So you can forget about \NNaoki, as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.65,1:25:32.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The things Irie and I have in common
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.61,1:25:35.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,went away, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.07,1:25:37.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And the last one is gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.54,1:25:46.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, dolphins!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.58,1:25:49.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They are so big. Isn't it something?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.37,1:25:50.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And look how friendly they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.83,1:25:52.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's those two, and that one over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.59,1:25:53.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Penguins!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.50,1:25:55.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get a load of that. There's a bunch of them!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.80,1:25:57.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They are really cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.38,1:26:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.10,1:26:09.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.52,1:26:12.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.98,1:26:14.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.98,1:26:16.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.82,1:26:17.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.32,1:26:20.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was thinking about \Nhow pretty the fishes are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.16,1:26:22.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.91,1:26:26.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, where are we going next?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.45,1:26:28.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was hoping to go to the arcade, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.96,1:26:29.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.46,1:26:31.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They have a crane game where...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.00,1:26:32.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wanna get married?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.42,1:26:40.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've wanted to ask you \Nsince I was in high school.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.09,1:26:43.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't picture anyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.35,1:26:45.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But you as my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.31,1:26:50.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Marry me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.27,1:26:56.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.53,1:27:01.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He proposed?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.82,1:27:04.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's pretty bold, Kinnosuke.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.03,1:27:05.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So? What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.95,1:27:07.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything, yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.70,1:27:11.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I like Kin as a friend, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.79,1:27:13.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.12,1:27:16.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Someone who cares about you, that much...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.00,1:27:18.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll find \Nanyone else like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.80,1:27:20.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.26,1:27:24.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think Kinnosuke is a better \Nmatch for you than Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.89,1:27:29.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You should use this as a chance\N to think about it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.23,1:27:38.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.69,1:27:40.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.03,1:27:41.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Puffer House is closed tomorrow, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.99,1:27:44.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wanna cook something for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.86,1:27:47.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll make a whole feast! \NSo why don't you come by?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.83,1:27:48.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A feast?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.70,1:27:49.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.62,1:27:50.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.79,1:27:52.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.04,1:27:55.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm gonna whip up my best stuff! \NLook foward to it, alright?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.88,1:28:06.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, I went to the realtor today...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.05,1:28:08.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've found a nice house.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.56,1:28:11.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.31,1:28:12.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a bit small,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.23,1:28:15.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but since you're getting \Nmarried, eventually...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.48,1:28:17.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then it'll be just me, and it'll be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.73,1:28:21.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.07,1:28:25.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you be glad if I married Kin?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.62,1:28:33.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What brought this on?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.00,1:28:36.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just a what-if.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.54,1:28:39.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What-if?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.80,1:28:43.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, that kid's a bit of an airhead,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.67,1:28:45.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but when it comes to cooking, \Nhe knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.09,1:28:49.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He could becomea fine chef, someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.18,1:28:52.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If it was you two, together...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.01,1:28:55.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He could took the restaurant \Nover, and that'd be great...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.23,1:28:59.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Er, no, no, nah,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.52,1:29:01.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,your feelings come first, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.23,1:29:04.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.32,1:29:07.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to bed, today.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.91,1:29:10.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.83,1:29:11.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.00,1:29:21.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, you drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.79,1:29:26.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But Naoki and Sahoko's \Nrelationship is going so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.17,1:29:31.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And now Kotoko has \Nbeen dating Kinnosuke.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.97,1:29:35.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It all makes me so sad!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.02,1:29:39.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, about Naoki, actually...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.27,1:29:41.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,President Oizumi asked me
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.11,1:29:44.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,when they were going to get engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.07,1:29:46.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When do you think it'll be?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.11,1:29:51.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.33,1:29:54.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki's an adult now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.62,1:29:58.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If he's made up his mind, we \Nshouldn't be second-guessing him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.83,1:30:01.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When Naoki said he wanted to be a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.17,1:30:03.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,who was the one second-guessing him?!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.34,1:30:13.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Looks like rain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.35,1:30:15.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I suppose we should head back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.18,1:30:16.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.35,1:30:18.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's raining or hailing,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.23,1:30:19.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,the tennis club doesn't take breaks!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.69,1:30:24.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Same old Sudo.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.48,1:30:25.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.86,1:30:27.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't see the pest around today.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.69,1:30:29.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you mean Aihara?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.15,1:30:32.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ever since she started dating \Nthe guy from the cafeteria,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.37,1:30:33.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,she's stopped coming by.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.37,1:30:37.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, are you going to quit school?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.50,1:30:40.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I had planned on just taking time off. \NBut the way things are going...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.54,1:30:41.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.38,1:30:43.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good luck, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.21,1:30:45.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.71,1:30:46.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.93,1:30:55.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.81,1:30:57.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto. How've you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.35,1:31:02.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, in spite of your rejection,\N I'm doing fine, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.52,1:31:06.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You know, I don't like that woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.77,1:31:08.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Overly perfect women are boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.28,1:31:12.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You'd have been better off with Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.07,1:31:14.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That way I'd still be able \Nto claim I'm the better choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.91,1:31:23.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No matter who you end up marrying,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.08,1:31:25.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hope you're still the cool Irie I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.21,1:31:27.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.14,1:31:35.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.60,1:31:40.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're getting married?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.06,1:31:43.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko was pretty down about it...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.64,1:31:44.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.94,1:31:47.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But isn't she dating Kinnosuke?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.19,1:31:51.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was surprised by how bold he was...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.24,1:31:54.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Proposing to her out of the blue like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.32,1:31:57.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And she's actually thinking it over...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.41,1:31:59.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They're a pretty good match, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.12,1:32:03.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's cooking for her at Puffer House today.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.04,1:32:06.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe she'll be giving her answer today!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.29,1:32:10.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow! Maybe Kotoko will be the \Nfirst one to get married?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.55,1:32:13.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But the way she was so \Ncrazy in love with Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.84,1:32:16.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It should make for a nice memory for their youths.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.14,1:32:17.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't you think, Irie?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.39,1:32:20.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.89,1:32:26.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Brought you some fruit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.44,1:32:27.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.94,1:32:29.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was really delicious!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.48,1:32:32.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you want seconds of anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.11,1:32:33.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am stuffed!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.24,1:32:34.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Couldn't eat another bite.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.70,1:32:40.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seeing you look so satisfied \Nmakes it worth the effort!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.66,1:32:43.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're going to be a great chef some day.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.50,1:32:45.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad said as much.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.92,1:32:50.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If it's for you, Kotoko, I could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.63,1:32:58.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So... uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.01,1:33:00.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,About our futures...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.22,1:33:04.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have you thought about...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.02,1:33:05.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The thing I asked you about?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.69,1:33:10.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh... well...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.73,1:33:14.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will you please give me more time?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.03,1:33:18.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I’m still..
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.86,1:33:19.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Still what?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.62,1:33:22.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thinking about Irie?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.00,1:33:26.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You still like him, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.25,1:33:28.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.04,1:33:30.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.46,1:33:33.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it about that cold \Nbastard that's so good?!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.80,1:33:35.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.89,1:33:49.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can make you forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.65,1:33:55.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.32,1:34:01.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.66,1:34:04.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I figured it was Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.66,1:34:06.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.58,1:34:11.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.67,1:34:12.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.31,1:34:28.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit all...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.53,1:34:38.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm so awful!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.40,1:34:41.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I got Kin's hopes up...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.91,1:34:44.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And then I blurt out Irie's name.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.16,1:34:48.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard about \Nit, and decided to give up....
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.66,1:34:50.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But it still comes back to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.84,1:35:04.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.55,1:35:07.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be a serious professional woman,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.35,1:35:09.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and remain single for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.48,1:35:12.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When I die, I will be buried with
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.94,1:35:15.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie's photo in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.50,1:36:19.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.50,1:36:21.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.92,1:36:23.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why are you out in the rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.72,1:36:26.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.14,1:36:27.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.72,1:36:28.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get under the umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.52,1:36:37.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were seeing him?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.77,1:36:40.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinnosuke.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.11,1:36:42.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.23,1:36:43.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I heard that he proposed to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.15,1:36:45.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.45,1:36:48.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See, guys do like me...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.03,1:36:49.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.78,1:36:52.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.41,1:36:53.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.04,1:36:58.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think I'll marry Kin.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.17,1:37:02.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That'd make everything go smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.67,1:37:04.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you like him?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.88,1:37:07.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you fall for someone \Njust because they like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.01,1:37:08.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why? Is there something wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.97,1:37:10.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even though you love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.26,1:37:11.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.68,1:37:13.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You do love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.64,1:37:15.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You couldn't love anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.56,1:37:19.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NAnd so confident... fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.40,1:37:21.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But what am I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.11,1:37:25.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Because you don't love me!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.82,1:37:27.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I should just...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.22,1:37:49.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I forbid you to say "I love you" \Nto any other guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.84,1:37:51.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's the second time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.18,1:37:54.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.64,1:37:56.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That we've kissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.77,1:37:59.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's the third time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.23,1:38:01.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.44,1:38:03.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You don't have to count them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.38,1:38:30.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Aihara...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.93,1:38:33.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you really have to move out?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.60,1:38:37.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, I've discussed this with Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.56,1:38:43.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If we keep going on like this, \Nit's just going to be hard on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.03,1:38:49.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Iri... thanks for looking after us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.20,1:38:51.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ai...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.99,1:38:53.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.03,1:38:59.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I appreciate everything you've \Ndone for us this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.47,1:39:10.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sir...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.09,1:39:12.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.51,1:39:14.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.55,1:39:16.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I would like...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.10,1:39:19.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To marry Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.73,1:39:27.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki?!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.94,1:39:29.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're not joking, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.07,1:39:33.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah. I finally realize something...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.49,1:39:40.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to marry Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.21,1:39:45.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that alright with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.42,1:39:53.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, Naoki... this girl... she can't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.84,1:39:55.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.72,1:39:59.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But y'know, Naoki, she's kinda \Ndumb, and can't cook...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.52,1:40:00.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.81,1:40:03.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But Naoki, she's a real goofball, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.19,1:40:04.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's always messing up!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.60,1:40:05.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.31,1:40:07.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.73,1:40:08.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, see...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.53,1:40:10.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.40,1:40:15.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's sunny, and is a hard worker!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.95,1:40:19.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's really earnest, and I love her!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.16,1:40:22.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.42,1:40:33.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.18,1:40:39.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take good care... of Kotoko, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.52,1:40:42.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.52,1:40:46.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think, Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.31,1:40:48.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.65,1:40:54.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.88,1:41:18.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.72,1:41:22.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.97,1:41:28.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that in the morning \Nthe cold Irie will return.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.15,1:41:32.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then let's sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.19,1:41:33.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.78,1:41:38.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you really sure about... me?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.24,1:41:39.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.41,1:41:44.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.58,1:41:46.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.46,1:41:48.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.56,1:42:05.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.45,1:42:21.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.03,1:42:24.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Y'know, our Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.66,1:42:28.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's the happiest girl in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.44,1:42:56.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Marriage?!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.15,1:42:59.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you sure you haven't finally lost it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.61,1:43:01.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's real!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.03,1:43:06.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So the campus bulletin is real?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.41,1:43:07.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.50,1:43:13.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.71,1:43:17.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm making Kotoko my life model.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.50,1:43:18.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.42,1:43:24.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.10,1:43:35.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dissolve the engagement?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.73,1:43:38.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know this can't be easily forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.94,1:43:43.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But I can't deny how I feel any longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.37,1:43:47.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,About Miss Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.25,1:43:53.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were cold to her...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.37,1:43:57.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But that's because you were\Nsincere with her, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.09,1:44:01.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was jealous of her, because of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.76,1:44:06.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was hoping you would never realize
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.51,1:44:11.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,how you really felt about her.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.20,1:44:26.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.54,1:44:32.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.09,1:44:51.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you not satisfied with Sahoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.64,1:44:52.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.85,1:44:54.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In my opinion, Miss Sahoko
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.68,1:44:56.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,is a wonderful woman, and \Nmore than I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.52,1:44:58.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.94,1:45:00.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Because there's someone,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.52,1:45:03.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,who for all her imperfections, \Nthat I like more than Miss Sahoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.24,1:45:06.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is it that girl who spilled sugar
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.45,1:45:08.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,during that meeting?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.66,1:45:10.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.70,1:45:12.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.04,1:45:14.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You live long enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.58,1:45:17.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you can figure things out\N from how people act.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.09,1:45:21.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, Naoki,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.38,1:45:26.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The new product line you \Nproposed has been very popular.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.30,1:45:32.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hokueisha's stock price is soaring.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.60,1:45:38.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.86,1:45:43.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for Sahoko,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.28,1:45:47.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but business is business.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.32,1:45:53.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,After this, we will continue to
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.24,1:45:55.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,support PANDAI, going forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.96,1:45:59.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.17,1:46:03.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.80,1:46:08.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a pity that I couldn't \Nbe your grandfather-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.47,1:46:12.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.86,1:46:31.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.28,1:46:34.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm busy. Could you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.41,1:46:38.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen, Kin... please.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.79,1:46:39.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinnosuke.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.83,1:46:44.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I have something to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.50,1:46:46.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.71,1:46:48.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going to marry Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.34,1:46:52.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hard as that may be for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.05,1:46:53.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going to marry Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.22,1:46:58.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.81,1:47:01.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you can't make Kotoko happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.56,1:47:02.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I won't let you go off easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.48,1:47:05.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Make her shed even one tear,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.40,1:47:08.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and I will come to Kotoko's rescue anytime.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.23,1:47:10.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.28,1:47:13.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kin.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.37,1:47:18.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,As long as Kotoko's happy, I'm satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.04,1:47:21.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, get going!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.79,1:47:29.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinnosuke. Well done!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.42,1:47:31.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're a real man!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.01,1:47:33.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Amazing! I'm touched!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.30,1:47:37.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.06,1:47:41.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hate this, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.48,1:47:43.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.73,1:47:50.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wanted to call you "Dad"!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.40,1:47:54.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, with Naoki and \NKotoko getting together,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.78,1:47:58.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm back on the job, and the \Ncompany has held together!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.16,1:48:00.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki's back in medical school,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.25,1:48:02.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,all's well that ends well!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.25,1:48:05.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's keep the positive momentum going,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.71,1:48:08.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so make sure to keep \NNovember 21st open, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.75,1:48:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I was gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.42,1:48:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's when....
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.17,1:48:14.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cancel anything you had planned!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.68,1:48:16.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What date is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.18,1:48:21.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki and Kotoko's wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.70,1:48:44.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This really is sudden, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.75,1:48:47.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Less than two weeks after the proposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.33,1:48:50.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie's mom is scary powerful!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.34,1:48:52.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Powerful!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.97,1:49:00.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.02,1:49:04.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.06,1:49:08.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You seem pretty nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.02,1:49:09.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't mess up during the ceremony, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.03,1:49:13.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.28,1:49:16.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got something good to \Ntell you, as a wedding gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.37,1:49:28.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.54,1:49:34.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is a wedding gift from your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.30,1:49:35.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.55,1:49:41.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that diamond?!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.97,1:49:48.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's the diamond engagement ring I \Nbought for your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.10,1:49:50.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We had it changed into a necklace.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.90,1:49:55.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.19,1:49:57.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.41,1:50:00.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.07,1:51:21.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.66,1:51:24.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.24,1:51:28.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've liked me for a while now, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.62,1:51:33.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki told me about the kiss at Kiyosato.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.88,1:51:34.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.96,1:51:38.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've been infatuated with me, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.97,1:51:48.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.18,1:51:52.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've got me. I'll surrender, to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.61,1:51:58.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.73,1:52:00.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,my road to love has been a long one.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.40,1:52:04.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And although I've shed tears,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.49,1:52:07.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko Aihara is now the wife \Nof Irie, who she's always loved!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.21,1:56:34.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on everyone, time \Nto board the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.30,1:56:36.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.36,1:56:53.44,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki & Kotoko
